,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, the county&rsquo;s middle value saw January to February at 29% of normal and August to September at 41%. Grid 24468 had its driest year in 2025 at 63% of normal, and grid 24167 did the same at 63%.</p>"}
